{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/IRON_HUNTERS_V2b.png?t=1749311589\" /></div><br>As a member of the <strong>Iron Hunters</strong> organization, it is your mission  to hunt down criminals and mercenaries hidden on dangerous planets. While you search for your objective, you must fight against the hostile fauna of the place and prepare for the final challenge.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight hordes of enemies and\u00a0choose weapons and skills to create synergies and powerful mecha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/StoreGif_Mixed2.gif?t=1749311589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Explore different planets and face their dangerous fauna</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/LavaWorldGif.gif?t=1749311589\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons, parts and power-ups for your mecha permanently</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/Upgrade.gif?t=1749311589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path. The greater the risk, the greater the rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/Map.gif?t=1749311589\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2773630?t=1749311589","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749311589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/769e77be8deb5f0dea7d2a2ed338c75359010177/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749311589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/769e77be8deb5f0dea7d2a2ed338c75359010177/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749311589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features non-stop action and combat is accompanied by frequent splashes of blood, monster ooze, and dismemberment as players exterminate the alien forces."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/IRON_HUNTERS_V2b.png?t=1749311589\" /></div><br>As a member of the <strong>Iron Hunters</strong> organization, it is your mission  to hunt down criminals and mercenaries hidden on dangerous planets. While you search for your objective, you must fight against the hostile fauna of the place and prepare for the final challenge.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight hordes of enemies and\u00a0choose weapons and skills to create synergies and powerful mecha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773630/extras/StoreGif_Mixed2.gif?t=17493